# --- Private agent memory (not for a public repo) ---
kit/memory/

# --- Stale mirrors of the live top-level notes ---
# nerdsnipe/ and projects/ at the repo root are the current copies; these
# kit/ snapshots are older and smaller. Keep the one note with no counterpart.
kit/nerdsnipe/
kit/projects/*
!kit/projects/weighted-adjacency-matrix-vertices-2108.md

